{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさまこんばんは(｡・・｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日奈子だよ～٩(◦`꒳´◦)۶♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この2日間はお父さんが出張で家にいないので、いつもはお父さんとお母さんのベットをくっつけて間で寝てるけど、\nお父さんの大きいベットを広々と両手両足いっぱいに広げて寝てます٩(ˊᗜˋ*)و"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/11/12/4034390/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/11/12/4034390/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"外ハネおんぷちゃん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"純奈が好きな髪型"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/11/12/4034390/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あーものすごくかき氷が食べたい気分！最近毎日アイス食べてるんだけどね、\nアイスってほんと美味しいよね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"クリームチーズのアイス食べたい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スティックタイプとスプーンで食べるカップアイスがあるやつ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スティックタイプの棒アイスは\n川後さんに美味しいよ！って聞いて\n食べてみたら美味しくてはまったの！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スプーンで食べるカップの方のクリームチーズアイスは食べてないからはやくたべたいよー！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに今日は\nバニラチョコアイスと\nイチゴショートケーキ味のアイスたべたの！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それから今日は\nスタッフさんに頂いた\nくるみパンとメロンパンとレーズンパンとクリームコロネも食べたよ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たべすぎ♡夜ご飯のさんまも美味しかった！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつまでも、食欲の秋だから仕方ないよねっていう言い訳をしてしまう(｡・・｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"食欲の秋だから仕方ないよねっ(｡・・｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふふふ(｡・・｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/11/12/4034390/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/11/12/4034390/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うーーーーー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/11/12/4034390/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はUPDATE girlsの\n撮影だったんだけど、\nすごいおしゃれで個性的なお洋服着たの♪寝っ転がって片足あげたり、真剣に撮ったりふざけて撮ったり、楽しかったです♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"11月27日発売です！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/11/12/4034390/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日お仕事終わったら、お家に帰ってお母さんとクリスマスツリーだしたいな～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ホワイトツリーなの♪\n綺麗でかわいいよ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ！あのね！\n突然だけど、お料理ができるようになりたいんだ～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よく、パイ生地買ってきてチョコ買ってきて、パイ生地でチョコ包んでチンしてチョコパイつくってるんだけど\nお料理つくれるようになりたいな～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ！でも少し前に\n豆腐ハンバーグつくったよ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"餡かけきのこもソースにつくったんだけど、餡かけが餡かけにならなかった！！！かたいきのこのかたまりになっちゃって。、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"難しいね。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"真夏さんにスイーツの作り方を教わりたいです。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうだ！真夏さんといえば\nシナモロールの話をブログでしていて1人でわいてました♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"シナモロールかわいいですよね♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"白いふわふわの子犬♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/11/12/4034390/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/11/12/4034390/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"塩アイスポーズ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アイスを食べてるふりだよ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/11/12/4034390/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/11/12/4034390/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"書きたいことあるんだけど\nあと1枚しか写真載せられないから\nまた次の